  "solution": "**Logic : (First number + Third number) 4 = Second number**\n\n**Given : ****15, 104, 11**\n\n(15 + 11) 4 = 104\n\n26 × 4 = 104\n\n**104 = 104 (LHS =RHS)**\n\nSo, Following the same pattern in the given options \n\n \n• 18, 160, 16\n\n​(18 + 16) 4 = 160\n\n34 × 4 = 160\n\n136 ≠ 160 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• 13, 48, 10\n\n​(13 + 10) 4 = 48\n\n23 × 4 = 48\n\n92 ≠ 48 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• 17, 112, 11\n\n​(17 + 11) 4 = 112\n\n28 × 4 = 112\n\n112 = 112 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• 14, 154, 8\n\n​(14 + 8) 4 = 154\n\n22 × 4 =154\n\n88 ≠ 48 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"****17, 112, 11\"** is the correct answer.\n\n94:T9e",
